{
  "name" : "Chakrabarty2010 - A control theory approach to cancer remission aided by an optimal therapy",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>This is a reinvestigation of a previous model depicting cancer remission. It involves application of mathematical tools from control theory to assess the optimal approach during the use of Adaptive Cellular Immunotherapy and interleukin-2 treatment.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
